[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0601","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14766","title":"Google Chrome V8 引擎越界读写漏洞","description":"CVE-2025-14766是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14766"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-16T23:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:36:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Google Chrome 至 143.0.7499.147 或更高版本（Help→About Google Chrome 检查并安装更新，或通过 Chrome 自动更新机制推送），该漏洞已在上述版本中修复。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户需升级至 143.0.3650.96 或更高版本（edge://settings/help 手动检查更新）。使用 Chromium 系内核的第三方浏览器（含嵌入式 CEF 应用）应同步升级至 chromium-143.0.7499.146 及以上（Fedora 可执行 sudo dnf update chromium）。由于攻击需用户交互且为远程可利用，升级前请勿在不可信网站上访问任意链接或打开未知 HTML 页面，并可通过组策略强制启用浏览器自动更新、限制 WebGPU 及 V8 JIT 相关实验特性作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_16.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/466786677","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2025/CVE-2025-14766.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14766.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/67e4f2259ee77a0081a521c1e645484964f36ab6/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14766.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14766.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14766.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-14766.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-14766.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/3a0926c12f22eacd86d7f002f1c29316f873b4ce/data/2025/CVE-2025-14765-InfoSecAntara_CVE-2025-14765-and-CVE-2025-14766.md","htt