_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0088.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0374","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0374.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-62847","title":"QNAP QTS/QuTS hero 命令参数分隔符注入漏洞","description":"QNAP NAS 操作系统（QTS 5.2.x、QuTS hero h5.2.x 及 h5.3.x）中存在命令参数分隔符不当 neutralization 漏洞（CWE-88）。攻击者通过向受影响设备发送精心构造的 SMB 域名（domain_name）参数，利用该参数在系统调用前缺乏有效验证的缺陷，可注入恶意命令分隔符从而篡改系统执行逻辑。远程未经身份认证的攻击者（网络邻近即可触发）可利用此漏洞绕过身份验证或获取未授权访问权限，影响用户数据与系统安全。该漏洞源于 Pwn2Own 2025 赛事，由 DEVCORE 研究团队发现并报告，QNAP 已在 2025 年 10 月发布的安全更新（QTS 5.2.7.3297、QuTS hero h5.2.7.3297 及 h5.3.1.3292 构建版本）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-62847"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-12-16T03:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:52:31Z","remediation":"立即将 QNAP NAS 操作系统升级至已修复版本：QTS 升级至 5.2.7.3297 build 20251024 或更高版本，QuTS hero 升级至 h5.2.7.3297 build 20251024 或 h5.3.1.3292 build 20251024 或更高版本。操作步骤：登录 QNAP 设备 Web 管理界面，进入「控制台」→「系统」→「固件更新」，点击「在线更新」检查并安装最新固件。如暂无法升级，建议通过 QuFirewall 或外部防火墙限制对 NAS 管理端口（默认 8080/8443）的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 段连接，降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-25-45","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62847.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62847.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-62847","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-62847.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/12/GHSA-qv28-7w47-rrhx/GHSA-qv28-7w47-rrhx.json","https://github.com/wagov/wasocshared/blob/600d13e462af32d74b0d6b4ba5f50091455779d1/docs/advisories/20251110001-QNAP-Critical-Updates.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2025-62847","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-62847.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2025/11/2025-11-09-report.md","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/5065dafd85905000b1059d7edda6091ac1b72962/Intel%20Reports/cybersecuritynews_com/qnap-zero-day-vulnerabilities-exploited/content.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0556","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13281","title":"Portworx kube-controller-manager 半盲 SSRF 漏洞","description":"kube-controller-manager 在使用内置 Portworx StorageClass 时存在半盲服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。该漏洞允许已授权用户通过构造恶意 StorageClass 配置，诱导 kube-controller-manager 向控制平面主机网络中未受保护的端点（包括链路本地或环回服务）发起请求，从而泄露任意敏感信息。该漏洞影响使用内置 Portworx StorageClass 的 Kubernetes 集群，CVSS 评分 5.8（中等危害），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度高，需要高权限且无需用户交互，影响范围扩大至控制平面，仅影响机密性。攻击者需具备授权用户权限，通过构造恶意存储类配置触发 SSRF 实现内部端点信息泄露。建议升级至修复版本或禁用内置 Portworx StorageClass。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13281"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-14T22:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Kubernetes 到 1.31.0 及以上版本（已修复 Portworx in-tree 存储插件的 SSRF 漏洞），或迁移至 Portworx CSI 驱动替代 in-tree 插件。若暂时无法升级，可通过网络策略限制 kube-controller-manager 对链路本地/回环地址的访问，或在网络策略中禁止 Pod 访问 169.254.0.0/16 和 127.0.0.0/8 网段作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/135525","https://groups.google.com/g/kubernetes-security-announce/c/EORqZg0k1l4/m/TtD-q0v7AgAJ","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/12/01/4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ab103c90c9554428eb622a04965c1c7518c48505/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/GHSA/data/2025/CVE-2025-13281.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-132xx/CVE-2025-13281.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0556.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0594","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0594.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14373","title":"Google Chrome Android 工具栏实现不当导致域名欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome Android 版本 143.0.7499.110 之前版本的工具栏实现不当，存在域名欺骗漏洞（CWE-1021）。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTML 页面，利用工具栏对源站域名显示逻辑的缺陷，诱导用户误信恶意页面为合法站点，实施钓鱼攻击。攻击需用户交互（UI:R），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N），仅影响机密性（C:L），CVSS 4.3 中危。影响 Chrome Android 版本 < 143.0.7499.110，Google 已在 143.0.7499.110 版本修复，用户升级即可防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14373"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-12T20:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:49Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Android 版 Google Chrome 升级至 143.0.7499.110 或更高版本（通过 Google Play 商店更新）；openSUSE 用户请将 Chromium 升级至 143.0.7499.109 或更高版本（执行 `sudo zypper update chromium`）。临时缓解：避免点击不明链接，访问敏感网站时仔细核对地址栏域名，防止域名欺骗攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_10.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/461532432","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-143xx/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-14373.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-14373.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0594.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0594.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0600","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14174","title":"谷歌 Chromium 浏览器内存溢出访问漏洞","description":"Google Chrome Mac 版本 143.0.7499.110 之前版本的 ANGLE 图形库 Metal 后端存在越界内存访问漏洞（CWE-787/CWE-119）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问精心构造的 HTML 页面，触发 ANGLE Metal 后端的越界内存写入，导致越界内存访问，可能造成任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 macOS 上的 Google Chrome 及 iOS Safari，CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限但需要用户交互，机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为高。Google 已在 Chrome 143.0.7499.110 中修复该漏洞，Apple 也已在相应 Safari 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14174"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-12T20:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:27Z","remediation":"建议立即将 macOS 版 Google Chrome 升级至 143.0.7499.110 或更高版本（通过 Chrome 菜单 → 关于 Chrome 自动更新），Debian 12/13 用户请执行 apt update && apt upgrade chromium 升级至 DSA-6083-1 修复版本。若暂时无法更新，可暂时禁用 GPU 加速（Chrome 启动参数添加 --disable-gpu）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_10.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/466192044","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/deployedge/microsoft-edge-relnotes-security","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-14174","https://github.com/typeconfused/CVE-2025-14174-analysis","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-14174.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/108e5bd2f6b0654ca198ffd5856fd6af45552cd4/2025/CVE-2025-14174.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14174.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14174.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/fc9722130a529f009f2a36114f777e1872532eca/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-14174.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/ec0f7de5ca22e24b94d11d39cf5f4d1c9ee2e7ef/2025/CVE-2025-14174.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/fc9722130a529f009f2a36114f777e1872532eca/data/2025/CVE-2025-14174-zeroxjf_CVE-2025-14174-analysis.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14174.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/7b8e7e5af5233a2630f933b801f3ed8edf9e12e7/2025/CVE-2025-14174/README.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-14174.md","https://github.com/0xjohnnydev/WebKit-UAF-ANGLE-OOB-Analysis","https://github.com/Satirush/CVE-2025-14174-Poc","https://github.com/George0Papasotiriou/CVE-2025-14174-Chrome-Zero-Day","https://github.com/sakyu7/sakyu7.github.io"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0600.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0593","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14372","title":"谷歌 Chrome 浏览器 密码管理器 Use 后空漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 143.0.7499.110 及 144.0.7539.0 之前版本的密码管理器组件存在使用后释放（Use After Free）漏洞，攻击者可诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意 HTML 页面，触发内存释放后引用错误，进而突破沙箱隔离实现沙箱逃逸。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 143.0.7499.110 及 144.0.7539.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 6.1（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、需用户交互、权限范围改变，成功利用可导致低机密性和完整性影响。攻击者需诱导受害者访问恶意页面并进行交互才能触发漏洞，Google 已在 Chrome 143.0.7499.110 及 144.0.7539.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14372"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-12T20:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:49Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Google Chrome 至 143.0.7499.110 或更高版本，或升级 Chromium 至 144.0.7539.0 及以上版本。可通过 Chrome 菜单→帮助→关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新并重启浏览器完成升级。若无法立即升级，可临时禁用密码管理器自动填充功能（设置→自动填充和密码→密码管理器→关闭\"自动登录\"）以降低风险。企业环境可通过组策略强制推送更新策略。openSUSE 用户请执行 `zypper patch` 安装 openSUSE-SU-2025:20161-1 补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_10.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/460599518","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-14372.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14372.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14372.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14372.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14372.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-14372.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14372.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-14372.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14372.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-143xx/CVE-2025-14372.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0593.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0352","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-67726","title":"Tornado Multipart 参数解析二次方拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Tornado 是一个 Python Web 框架和异步网络库，其 `httputil.py` 中的 `_parseparam` 函数在解析 `multipart/form-data` 等 HTTP 头部参数时使用了低效算法，在处理包含引号分号（如 `param=\";\"`）的参数时会在嵌套循环中反复调用 `string.count()`。攻击者可通过向 `Content-Disposition` 头部发送大量恶意构造的参数，使服务器 CPU 使用率呈二次方增长（O(n²)），导致拒绝服务。由于 Tornado 采用单事件循环架构，单个恶意请求即可使整个服务器长时间无响应。该漏洞影响 Tornado 6.5.2 及以下版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 6.5.3 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-67726","GHSA-jhmp-mqwm-3gq8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-12-12T07:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:58:02Z","remediation":"立即将 Tornado 升级至 6.5.3 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade tornado），该版本已修复 `_parseparam` 函数在解析 multipart 参数时的 O(n²) 性能问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）限制 `Content-Disposition` 头部的参数数量，或对上传请求进行速率限制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/771472cfdaeebc0d89a9cc46e249f8891a6b29cd","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/releases/tag/v6.5.3","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/security/advisories/GHSA-jhmp-mqwm-3gq8","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/blob/e530031405e2154654dedc4c84d5656b557ea310/docs/releases/v6.5.3.rst","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/tornado/CVE-2025-67726.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-67726","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/1a52ff8ec1bcb2a7098656810eca5dcfa9f4ec17/community/py3-tornado/APKBUILD","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-67726.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-python/recipes-devtools/python/python3-tornado/CVE-2025-67726.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0352.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0352.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0351","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-67725","title":"Tornado HTTPHeader 合并二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Tornado 是一个 Python Web 框架和异步网络库，其 `HTTPHeaders.add` 方法在处理同一请求头名称重复时通过字符串拼接累积值。由于 Python 字符串不可变性，每次拼接都复制整个字符串，导致时间复杂度达 O(n²)。攻击者可利用 Tornado 单事件循环架构，构造包含大量重复头部的恶意 HTTP 请求，长期阻塞服务端事件循环，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Tornado 6.5.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-67725","GHSA-c98p-7wgm-6p64"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-12-12T06:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:58:02Z","remediation":"升级 Tornado 至 6.5.3 或更高版本（`pip install 'tornado>=6.5.3'`）。如无法立即升级，保持 `max_header_size` 为默认值 64KB 可有效限制攻击面，同时可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）限制请求头大小作为额外缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/771472cfdaeebc0d89a9cc46e249f8891a6b29cd","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/releases/tag/v6.5.3","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/security/advisories/GHSA-c98p-7wgm-6p64","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/blob/e530031405e2154654dedc4c84d5656b557ea310/docs/releases/v6.5.3.rst","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/tornado/CVE-2025-67725.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-67725","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/1a52ff8ec1bcb2a7098656810eca5dcfa9f4ec17/community/py3-tornado/APKBUILD","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-67725.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/home-assistant/buildroot/blob/dfa1d775aa4f26502c4214516050117192aeff12/package/python-tornado/python-tornado.mk"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0350","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-67724","title":"Tornado HTTP 响应标头注入与跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Tornado Python Web 框架的 `set_status` 方法与 `HTTPError` 类在处理 `reason` 参数时存在输入验证缺陷。当应用程序将不可信数据作为 `reason` 参数传递时，该参数未经过转义处理即被直接写入 HTTP 响应头或默认错误页面的 HTML 中，攻击者可利用此漏洞实现 HTTP 响应头注入或跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。该漏洞影响 Tornado 6.5.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.4（中危），厂商已发布 6.5.3 版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-67724","GHSA-pr2v-jx2c-wg9f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-12-12T06:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:58:02Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Tornado 升级至 6.5.3 或更高版本，该版本已对 `reason` 参数进行转义处理，防止未转义数据被注入 HTTP 响应头或默认错误页面导致 XSS 攻击。如无法升级，应避免将任何不可信用户输入直接传入 `RequestHandler.set_status()` 或 `tornado.web.HTTPError` 的 `reason` 参数，或对输入进行严格的 HTML 实体编码和换行符过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/9c163aebeaad9e6e7d28bac1f33580eb00b0e421","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/releases/tag/v6.5.3","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/security/advisories/GHSA-pr2v-jx2c-wg9f","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/blob/e530031405e2154654dedc4c84d5656b557ea310/docs/releases/v6.5.3.rst","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/tornado/CVE-2025-67724.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-67724","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/f2436d78ccf1a868d705d0305d48ada5b79684e6/community/py3-tornado/APKBUILD","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-python/recipes-devtools/python/python3-tornado/CVE-2025-67724.patch","https://github.com/home-assistant/buildroot/blob/dfa1d775aa4f26502c4214516050117192aeff12/package/python-tornado/python-tornado.mk"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0350.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0584","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0584.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13912","title":"wolfSSL 常时实现 LLVM 编译优化转为非常时代码导致时序侧信道信息泄露漏洞","description":"wolfSSL 5.8.4之前版本中存在常量时间实现被LLVM编译器优化破坏的漏洞。由于LLVM优化过程中可能将原本设计为恒定时间执行的安全关键代码转换为非恒定时间的二进制指令，导致不同输入下的程序执行时间产生可观测的差异。具有高权限的本地攻击者可通过精确测量程序响应时间来实施时序侧信道攻击，从而泄露受保护的敏感信息。该漏洞需本地访问且攻击复杂度较高。建议升级至wolfSSL 5.8.4及以上版本修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":1.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13912"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-11T18:16:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:58Z","remediation":"升级 wolfSSL 至 5.8.4 或更高版本（该版本已通过 volatile 关键字标记常时实现变量，防止 LLVM 优化破坏常时执行）。如无法立即升级，可在编译时添加 -fno-strict-overflow、-fwrapv 等禁用 LLVM 激进优化，并确保使用 O0/O1 优化级别编译常时代码路径；同时监控 wolfSSL 官方 PR#9148 补丁，尽快合并到代码库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9148","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13912.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-139xx/CVE-2025-13912.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0584.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0596","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0596.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14523","title":"GNOME Libsoup 重复主机头处理主机解析不一致漏洞","description":"Libsoup HTTP 库在处理请求头时存在解析差异漏洞：当请求中包含多个 Host: 头字段时，库会取最后一个 Host 值进行服务端处理，而常见的前端代理（如反向代理）通常使用第一个 Host 值进行路由转发。这种前后端主机解析不一致可导致虚拟主机混淆，使攻击者通过构造携带重复 Host 头的 HTTP 请求，将请求从代理路由至一个后端，但后端将其解析为针对另一个主机的请求。该漏洞可被利用实施请求走私（Request Smuggling）、缓存投毒以及绕过基于主机名的访问控制。影响范围涵盖使用受影响 Libsoup 版本的所有应用程序与服务，尤其影响部署了前置代理的 Web 服务架构。CVSS 评分为 8.2（高危），攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14523"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-11T13:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-29T21:16:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 libsoup 至 Red Hat 已发布修复版本：RHEL 8 用户将 libsoup 升级至 0:2.62.3-11.el8_10 或更新版本，RHEL 10 用户将 libsoup3 升级至 0:3.6.5-3.el10_1.8 或更新版本，RHEL 7 ELS 用户将 libsoup 升级至 0:2.62.2-10.el7_9 或更新版本。可通过执行 yum update libsoup 或 dnf upgrade libsoup 完成升级。若无法立即打补丁，可在反向代理层配置归一化规则，移除或去重传入请求的重复 Host 头字段，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0421","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0422","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0423","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0836","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0867","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0868","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0905","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0906","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0907","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0908","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0909","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0911","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:0925","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1509","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1569","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1570","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1571","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1572","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-14523","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2421349","https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libsoup/-/issues/472","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-14523.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14523.json","https: