","updated":"2026-07-13T17:16:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GLib 至 2.70.3 或更高版本（参考 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2026:15953 等多个勘误）。若暂无法升级，可通过编译选项禁用有问题的 GIO 属性转义功能，或在网络层面限制对处理文件系统扩展属性服务的访问，作为临时缓解措施。详见 GNOME 官方修复提交：https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib/-/issues/3845","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:15953","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:15969","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:15971","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19148","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19361","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19452","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19457","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19459","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19460","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19523","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19524","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19565","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19567","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21275","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:22634","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25096","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:29197","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7461","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-14512","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2421339","https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib/-/issues/3845","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14512.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14512.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14512.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14512.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2025/CVE-20